# Verify snapshot files must round-trip byte-for-byte: Verify itself writes
# them with \n line endings and rejects \r on comparison (see
# VerifiedLineEndingException). Without this, Windows checkouts get \r\n
# via core.autocrlf and every snapshot test fails on that platform alone.
*.verified.txt text eol=lf working-tree-encoding=UTF-8
*.verified.png binary
